# 统一按 LF 存储与检出。
# Windows 上 core.autocrlf=true 会让工作区变成 CRLF：编辑后 git status 报「已修改」
# 而 git diff 为空（假 M），每次提交还刷一串 "LF will be replaced by CRLF" 告警。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 脚本保持 CRLF：cmd.exe 与 Windows PowerShell 5.1 对纯 LF 的兼容性更差
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制资源不做换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.exe binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
